{
  "about": "wheel-calibration for Windows, from its real wheel: whole notches, then 40 units of a notch's 120, the same native events on both sides. Chromium reads 100 px from a notch and GPUI the system's three lines (X02). Upstream's side needs the Windows desktop; elsewhere the Electron driver refuses the actions",
